// Base build configuration — TRACKED. Nothing real belongs in this file.
//
// Every key below is deliberately EMPTY here and takes its value from the
// untracked Config/Secrets.xcconfig, which the `#include?` at the bottom pulls
// in last (in xcconfig the last assignment wins). Empty values leave the
// Info.plist keys empty and the app shows a one-line setup hint rather than
// crashing.
//
// Copy Config/Secrets.example.xcconfig to Config/Secrets.xcconfig and fill it
// in there. That file is gitignored, so a real credential cannot be committed.
//
// NOTE: "//" starts a comment in xcconfig — write URLs as https:/$()/host, no quotes.
PROXIMIIO_APPLICATION_TOKEN =
BLUEIOT_CLOUD_RELAY_URL =
BLUEIOT_CLOUD_RELAY_TOKEN =
#include? "Secrets.xcconfig"
